'''''Astragalus hamosus''''', the '''southern milk vetch''' or '''European milk vetch''', is a plant in the family [[Fabaceae]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Astragalus hamosus L. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/51592534|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Mifsud|first=Stephen|date=2002-08-23|title=Astragalus hamosus (Southern Milk Vetch) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands.|url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/FABC/Astragalus_hamosus.php|access-date=2022-02-07|website=www.maltawildplants.com|language=en-us}}</ref>

